WEBVTT

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.520
Cylinder rotation equal to 1G.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.140
Stable at plus-minus 0.2.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.480
No heat sources detected
within sensor range,

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.480
and no sign of particle flow.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.070
Normal communications channel open.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.570
The enemy isn't here yet.

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:09.200
We'll land at E65 where
there's lots of cover.

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.080
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.000
<i>Match your machine's landing
to the colony's rotation speed.</i>

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:14.960
Got it.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:16.870
<i>Off we go.</i>

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:43.030
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:48.530
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:51.280
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:54.040
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:59.580
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.130
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.760
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:12.350
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:15.060
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.770
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:23.070
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:29.610
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.970
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:01.310
<i>Yuu, prepare for sniping.</i>

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.110
<i>Aim for the cargo entrance
where we came in.</i>

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.230
Roger that.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.150
<i>And Sekai.</i>

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:11.570
<i>We'll watch the cargo entrance
on the opposite side.</i>

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:12.660
Right!

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.830
So, where will they come from?

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.250
<i>It</i> seems <i>the Try Fighters
chose to fight inside the colony.</i>

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:26.500
<i>They can make better use of
Sekai's kenpo under gravity.</i>

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.340
<i>What's the plan, Kijima?</i>

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:30.340
<i>No cheap tricks.</i>

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:34.470
<i>We'll each fight fairly
in our own style.</i>

00:03:35.390 --> 00:03:38.430
Are you telling us
to do as we please?

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.690
I was waiting to hear that!

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.320
It's a quiet start.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.160
Its the calm before the storm.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.240
Sakai, you're late.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:04.000
I was helping Yuuma until
this morning and overslept.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.420
How's the battle going?

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.170
No action yet.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.370
They anticipated us?

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:42.910
From this side, too!
They anticipated us?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:43.790
From this side, too!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:47.080
<i>Target and fire!</i>

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:55.180
Mr. Adou!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.510
Don't get hit...

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.600
'Cause here comes the big one!

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.640
From the outside?!

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.400
ls that Saga Adou?

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.240
<i>Hoshino, go back up Yuuma!</i>

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.150
But-

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.450
I'll stop Wilfrid Kijima!

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.500
Jigen Haoh School!

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.750
<i>(Blue Sky Crimson Fist)
Soten Guren-Ken!</i>

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:31.920
<i>Your moves are faster.</i>

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.130
<i>You tuned the machine
in just two days?</i>

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.760
<i>This is Yuuma's...</i>

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:40.100
No, this is the power of the
Gunpla that all of us worked on!

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.560
You just keep moving...

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.230
I'm going to fight for real now!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:51.940
Coach Allan.

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:54.190
Dr. Mikawa, why are you here?

00:05:54.190 --> 00:05:56.450
Stop the battle immediately!

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:59.110
If you don't, Adou's right hand will be...

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.700
What did you say?!

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.290
<i>Howl, fangs!</i>

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.210
The fangs are all moving differently.

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:11.790
He can control that many
of them manually?!

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:19.050
<i>Adou, why didn't you tell us
your right wrist wasn't healed?</i>

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.470
If you stop me, I'll thrash you.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:22.600
<i>Stop it now!</i>

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.640
<i>Do you want to ruin your future?</i>

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:26.310
I'm not that frail!

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:27.600
Shut up and watch!

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:32.310
Adou, why?

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.360
Why...?

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:35.980
Because I'm starving.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.690
Starving for a real battle!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.660
Go, Full Burnern!

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.510
You're good.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.190
He swallowed it?!

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:21.530
If I break through the field
like Granada Academy did...

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.580
I knew you'd do that.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:29.540
Same here!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.250
Get back, Shia!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.050
Adou, too! Regroup and-

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.460
<i>Are you kidding?</i>

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:41.550
It's just getting fun!

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.340
<i>Hey, pay attention.</i>

00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:44.220
What?

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:53.690
<i>That technique...</i>

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.650
Winning...

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:05.320
<i>It's not over yet!</i>

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.910
<i>You've got guts!</i>

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:12.500
Go!

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.420
<i>No you don't!</i>

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:19.590
...Beam!

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:41.740
The colony...

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:45.360
It's collapsing.

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:06.550
Hoshino...

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.050
Yuuma...

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:11.770
<i>Wh-Where am I?</i>

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:14.850
<i>This is a mining site
in a resource satellite.</i>

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.270
<i>Wilfrid...</i>

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:20.440
<i>...Kijima!</i>

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.780
<i>So, let's settle this.</i>

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.410
Sekai Kamiki!

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:37.000
<i>Mr. Adou.</i>

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.250
<i>We lost contact with my brother.</i>

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:41.340
Don't worry, he's not done yet.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:43.170
Watch out!

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:46.340
So they were repairing.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.390
Jigen Haoh School!

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:57.190
<i>(Gale Force Punch)
Shippu</i> Zuki!

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.110
Now it's our turn.

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:12.780
What?!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.210
<i>Th-Those are...</i>

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:25.300
That's right, lance bits.

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:33.140
If shooting won't work...

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:34.890
Let's get close!

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:37.390
You're careless! Fangs!

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:45.030
Yuu. Go!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.000
Gotcha!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:10:59.250
That's my line!

00:11:11.380 --> 00:11:12.340
<i>Yuu!</i>

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.100
With this, you're...

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:22.600
Not yet!

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:27.400
A secret weapon?!

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:38.450
Thank you.

00:11:38.450 --> 00:11:40.290
I'm sorry. I was hit.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.370
I'm also in bad shape.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:44.380
The Gunpla Academy is pretty good.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:46.960
Yeah, it's really exciting!

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.180
<i>Here's my killer move!</i>

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:06.150
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:09.480
<i>Remember that technique.</i>

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:25.500
What?!

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:36.260
A flaming sword...

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:41.020
ls he evolving in the
middle of a battle?

00:12:41.350 --> 00:12:43.640
<i>I'm just a beginner.</i>

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:47.980
I still have so much to do.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.110
Particle transfer complete.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.870
I'm betting it all on one shot
of the Winning Beam.

00:12:59.870 --> 00:13:00.950
Fumi...

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:04.330
If this were Gundam,
what would we say now?

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.000
How about,
"It sounds sad. But this is war"?

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.380
Then I guess that means we're dead.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:12.670
Let's go, Yuu!

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:13.630
Rogen

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:22.890
They're here.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.390
I can't complete the repairs.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:26.690
But you can use the fangs now.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:27.940
Good enough.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:33.280
I deferred to Kijima in the
semifinals, but not today!

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:37.610
Saga Adou!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:38.910
Fangs!

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.540
I'm grateful.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:50.000
I've waited for this moment.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.670
It's all thanks to you...

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:55.880
I've been waiting...

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.010
...that I was able...

00:13:57.130 --> 00:13:58.930
...for a battle like this!

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:01.010
...to become this strong!

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.100
Fumi!

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:09.020
Winning Beam!!

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:15.900
Shia?!

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:18.360
Full power!!

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.120
The particle band...!

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:59.150
Hoshino...

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.860
Yuuma...

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.320
Sekai!

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:06.160
The rest is up to you!

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.630
I'll chew you to pieces!

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.520
Yuuma Kousaka!

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:34.020
Saga Adou!

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:39.860
Mr. Adou...

00:15:46.330 --> 00:15:47.450
It's coming.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.580
Please move, Winning!

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.170
How unfortunate.

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:58.170
I wanted... to fight more.

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:03.220
Even just for a moment!

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:14.900
You're... amazing.

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:27.120
Let's play Gunpla Battle
one-on-one next time.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:29.200
Sure.

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.090
Hoshino!

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:42.090
You defeated Adou and Shia...

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.510
But it ends here.

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.430
Transient Burst!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:51.680
Darn it!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.280
I'll finish it with this!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.540
<i>Over the time limit.</i>

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.450
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.660
Time...

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:16.210
...limit?

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:21.210
Th-They hit the time limit.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.630
The battle is over.

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:26.220
<i>Both teams have
destroyed two machines.</i>

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:30.350
<i>As per the tournament rules,</i>

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:33.310
<i>after a three minute interval,</i>

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:37.900
<i>there will be an overtime battle
between team representatives.</i>

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.150
Adou, you pushed too hard.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.200
Your old injury was hurting?

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.530
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:50.030
It's fine.

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.040
I'd have done the same.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:53.620
Brother.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:59.460
The rules only allow repairs
with parts used in the battle.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:01.380
I'll add my weapons to yours.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:04.010
Can we use the Burst Lancer?

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:05.340
If it's only once.

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:06.510
That's enough.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:09.640
How is it? Can you fix it?

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:14.930
I thought this might happen.
So I remodeled all the machines.

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:16.480
Th-This is...

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:26.440
Unbelievable. The three machines'
polycaps have been made interchangeable!

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:31.070
Not just the Lightning,
but the Winning as well?

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.910
It sure was difficult.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:36.290
We practically had to
build them from scratch.

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:39.870
Sekai.

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:43.380
Take my Lightning and
Fumi's Winning with you.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.380
Yeah!

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:53.600
Sekai.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:57.180
Let's fight with a smile until the end!

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:58.690
Right.

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.360
<i>We now begin the overtime battle.</i>

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.160
<i>Let's go, Try Burning.</i>

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:16.830
<i>With Hoshino, Yuuma...</i>

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:19.500
<i>...and everybody</i> else!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.460
<i>To be able to savor
such a wonderful fight...</i>

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.960
This is why I can't
give up Gunpla Battle!

00:19:28.260 --> 00:19:29.590
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:54.950
Sekai.

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:57.830
Gunpla Battle is fun, isn't it?

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:58.330
Gunpla Battle is fun, isn't it?

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.540
<i>Oh yeah.</i>

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:04.130
<i>It's the greatest.</i>

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:05.330
Of course!

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:12.930
My brother's having fun.

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:13.300
Yeah.

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:13.680
Yeah.

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:16.930
This is his happiest moment!

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:17.220
This is his happiest moment!

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.070
Transient...

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.410
Burning...

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:41.580
Buuuuuuuuurst!
Buuuuuuuuurst!

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:50.360
Sekai.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:53.570
I forgot to tell you one thing.

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:56.740
A message from Mr. Sei lori...

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:57.320
A message from Mr. Sei lori...

00:21:58.530 --> 00:21:59.870
...who built the Build Burning.

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:01.200
...who built the Build Burning.

00:22:03.950 --> 00:22:04.540
"Someday, let's battle together."

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:07.620
"Someday, let's battle together."

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:16.920
<i>"I'll be waiting for you--- "</i>

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:17.510
<i>"I'll be waiting for you--- "</i>

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:20.340
<i>"...at the World Championship."</i>

00:22:27.020 --> 00:22:30.060
Episode 24
Final Burst

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:38.530
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:22:38.530 --> 00:22:41.910
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:41.910 --> 00:22:46.700
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:53.630
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:53.630 --> 00:23:00.380
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:23:02.140 --> 00:23:05.140
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:23:05.140 --> 00:23:08.520
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:11.310
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:15.150
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:19.820
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:24.580
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:23:24.580 --> 00:23:26.870
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:31.920
...a <i>different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:38.840
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:23:38.840 --> 00:23:42.300
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:44.720
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:45.260
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:45.260 --> 00:23:46.890
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:46.890 --> 00:23:47.770
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:50.770
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:53.150
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:53.150 --> 00:23:54.110
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:23:54.150 --> 00:24:00.030
Team Try Fighters!

00:24:00.360 --> 00:24:02.360
The builder's contest, the Meijin Cup.

00:24:02.360 --> 00:24:05.070
You'll see some brand new Gunpla there.

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:05.950
Final episode, "Our Gunpla".
Final episode, "Our Gunpla".

